Gogo: They say three days to reach the water, if it is there.
- Think it's there?
	Hope: Do you think it's there?
	Gogo: The paper says it is. I have been shown papers before.
	Gogo: But the paper did not come on the back of a lorry. This did.
- What can I do?
	Hope: What can I do?
	Gogo: Come and watch. Watching is allowed. Most of us will be doing nothing else.
Charity: The district signed for it. Unity Water paid for it. The committee will keep it — once there is a committee.
Charity: That part is ours. It always was.
